  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Meet the tote that carries everything and looks put together while doing it. Our Cleo tote bag in pebbled leather holds its shape through back-to-back meetings, and the detachable zip pouch means you're never excavating for your keys again. There's room to spare, without the slouch.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap drop: 12&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 16.26&quot; (L) x 10.43&quot; (H) x 4.72&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
